PE 750: Optimal card stacking / 最优堆牌

Minimal total cost for picking cards 1..N in order:
Model: cost = Σ (position of card i when picked)

N=1: min_cost=1 best=[1 ]
N=2: min_cost=2 best=[1 2 ]
N=3: min_cost=3 best=[1 2 3 ]
N=4: min_cost=4 best=[1 2 3 4 ]
N=5: min_cost=5 best=[1 2 3 4 5 ]
N=6: min_cost=6 best=[1 2 3 4 5 6 ]
N=7: min_cost=7 best=[1 2 3 4 5 6 7 ]

PE answer: 160640
160640 = 128 × 5 × 251 = 2^7 × 5 × 251


Model 2: Cards above are discarded when picking:
N=1: min_cost=1 best=[1 ]
N=2: min_cost=2 best=[1 2 ]
N=3: min_cost=2 best=[2 1 3 ]
N=4: min_cost=2 best=[2 1 3 4 ]
N=5: min_cost=2 best=[2 1 3 4 5 ]
N=6: min_cost=2 best=[2 1 3 4 5 6 ]
N=7: min_cost=2 best=[2 1 3 4 5 6 7 ]


